o-use-switch","content":"❌ For selections that require a \"Save\" or \"Submit\" action (use `Checkbox` instead)"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-73","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch#when-to-use-switch","content":"❌ For choosing one of several mutually exclusive options (use `Radio` or `SegmentedController` instead)"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-74","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch#labeling","content":"Prefer a visible label that names the setting being toggled (e.g. \"Wi-Fi\", not \"On/Off\")"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-75","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch#labeling","content":"If the label is omitted, always provide `aria-label`"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-76","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch#labeling","content":"Keep labels short and describe the setting, not its current state"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/components/tag","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"page","content":"Tag","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-0","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tag","content":"Non-interactive labels that highlight statuses and categories."},"1363":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-1","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag#installation","content":"Installation"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-2","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag#examples","content":"Examples"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-3","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tag#default","content":"Default"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/components/tag-4","page_id":"/docs/components/tag","type":"he